Subject: [PATCH 10/14] Lab: XCL_FILTER_INDEX=1 on the fix-waits tree (aa997d49
 from local/wtf-52884bf8)

Cherry-picked from aa997d49 (S/wwtf). The textures to upload before a
submit are found through a sorted index of the memory they are read
from instead of asking every texture kept in step; same textures, same
order (filter_index_picks_what_the_plain_filter_picks). Off unless
XCL_FILTER_INDEX=1.

Conflict resolved by hand in refresh_once: the TEXTURES lock stays
call_stats::lock(.., LockTextures) (call stats wrapping of 31fab203),
the index branch follows it. take_for_upload is the old filter_map
body unchanged.

(cherry picked from commit aa997d49106801092bff0bc54ba56978febda93d)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
